# Files excluded from the Cloudflare static-assets deploy (gitignore syntax).
# The deploy serves the repo root, so anything not a real site asset is listed
# here to keep tooling and docs off the public site.
# Served assets deliberately NOT listed: *.html, main.js, style.css,
# robots.txt, sitemap.xml, images/.

